---
layout: base.njk
title: CV
---
<h1>CV</h1>

<p>
  Built from <a href="https://github.com/JulianErskine/julian-CV">julian-CV</a>
  (LaTeX) and kept in sync automatically: publishing a release there triggers
  a rebuild of this site that fetches the latest PDF.
</p>

<div class="cv-download">
  <iframe class="cv-preview" name="cv-preview" src="/cv/public_cv-en.pdf#navpanes=0&amp;view=FitH" title="CV preview"></iframe>
  <div class="cv-meta">
    {%- if cvRelease %}
    <p class="cv-updated">
      Last updated<br>
      <time datetime="{{ cvRelease.publishedAt }}">{{ cvRelease.publishedAt.slice(0, 10) }}</time>
      ({{ cvRelease.tagName }})
    </p>
    {%- endif %}
    <ul>
      <li>
        English<br>
        <a href="/cv/public_cv-en.pdf#navpanes=0&amp;view=FitH" target="cv-preview">Preview</a> ·
        <a href="/cv/public_cv-en.pdf" download>Download</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Français<br>
        <a href="/cv/public_cv-fr.pdf#navpanes=0&amp;view=FitH" target="cv-preview">Aperçu</a> ·
        <a href="/cv/public_cv-fr.pdf" download>Télécharger</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
